    "detailed_description": "TOP SECRET FILE: <strong>THE STORM OF AREA 51 - 20/09/2019</strong>  <br>BURN AFTER PLAYING!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/ea519413d971b7d09d487440682e7b81.poster.avif?t=1575925687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/ea519413d971b7d09d487440682e7b81.webm?t=1575925687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/ea519413d971b7d09d487440682e7b81.mp4?t=1575925687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Lead your army of fans through the defense posts of Area 51 military base. Could you be the best raid leader among your friends? Or maybe you\u2019re the chosen one \u2013 Natural Born Legion Commander? Are you ready to accept the challenge?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/5e8e7aedd618f6d88fd218a5e569e271.avif?t=1575925687\" /></div><br>Run against different types of soldiers that become stronger the closer you are to Area 51 base.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/20dbe9ff1807971c50636c754e669483.avif?t=1575925687\" /></div><br>Place your forces effectively on the field to create invincible echelons.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/242b0d87e00db5333df203ad65d8c510.avif?t=1575925687\" /></div><br>Spend hype points to strengthen your Legion, combine units with different perks to create chemistry on the battlefield.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/f410261eb028d2e504215414bb736fef.avif?t=1575925687\" /></div><br>Catch the MLG moment to crush enemies with your special ability timing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158280/extras/89925073bffe187cc79cc5ec8d907ee6.avif?t=1575925687\" /></div><br>Watch them run, watch them fall - have fun!<br><br>There are just a few things you can watch forever: fire, water, and thousands of crazy fans falling while trying to raid highly guarded top-secret military facility with bare hands.",
